     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Comparative fact sheet",
     "texto": [
      "**Tour A**: Starts at 9:30, lasts 3 hours; visits the historic museum, which has stairs but no lift (not suitable for wheelchairs).",
      "**Tour B**: Starts at 10:15; route through the traditional market and the botanical garden, completely flat and accessible for wheelchair users.",
      "**Prices**: 18 euros for the general fare; 12 euros for students on presentation of an official student card.",
      "**General conditions**: Advance booking is compulsory; if it rains, the botanical garden is replaced by a visit to the library; groups are limited to a maximum of 15 people."
